  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat the oil in the bottom of a Dutch oven or clay tagine over medium heat.",
    "2. Add the onion and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, about 10 minutes.",
    "3. Add the ginger and garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "4. Add the carrots, caraway seeds, tagine spice, salt, and pepper.",
    "5. Stir to combine and bring to a boil.",
    "6. Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer until the carrots are tender, about 30 minutes.",
    "7. Stir in the parsley.",
    "8. Serve hot."
